explain (costs off)
select nspname
from (select 1 as x) ss1
left join
( select n.nspname, c.relname
  from pg_class c left join pg_namespace n on n.oid = c.relnamespace
  where c.relkind = 'r'
) ss2 on false;
           QUERY PLAN           
--------------------------------
 Nested Loop Left Join
   Join Filter: false
   ->  Result
   ->  Result
         One-Time Filter: false
